From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:54:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Charge threaded database SQLite heap to the process budget

Reserve the connection's SQLite allocations in 1 MiB steps through the copy's existing reservation. Refuse unbudgeted growth and return credit as the live heap shrinks or the connection closes.

Part of coworkerd/coworkerd#81

